Package: erodist-system
Version: 1.0.0~rc1-mint1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: EroDist <erodist@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, dconf-gsettings-backend, dconf-cli
Description: EroDist system centre and edition identity for Linux Mint Cinnamon
 Provides the settings hub, local system information and EroDist desktop defaults.
 Does not replace Mint package management or storage configuration backends.
